{"guid": "https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-10-01-ai-search-generally-available/", "title": "AI Search - AI Search is generally available", "summary": "<p>AI Search is now generally available. Usage-based billing begins on November 1, 2026, with included monthly ingestion, storage, semantic query, and full-text query usage. Cloudflare will send a reminder email the week before billing begins.</p>\n<p>Refer to <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-search/platform/limits-pricing/\">Limits &amp; pricing</a> for rates and included usage.</p>\n<div class=\"heading-wrapper level-h4\" tabindex=\"-1\"><h4 id=\"hybrid-search-is-on-by-default\">Hybrid search is on by default</h4><a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#hybrid-search-is-on-by-default\"><span class=\"anchor-icon\"><svg height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\" fill=\"currentcolor\"></path></svg></span></a></div>\n<p>New AI Search instances use hybrid search by default. Hybrid search combines semantic vector retrieval with full-text matching. You can choose a different index method when you create an instance.</p>\n<p>Refer to <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-search/configuration/indexing/hybrid-search/\">Hybrid search</a> for details.</p>\n<div class=\"heading-wrapper level-h4\" tabindex=\"-1\"><h4 id=\"workers-ai-embeddings-and-reranking-are-included\">Workers AI embeddings and reranking are included</h4><a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#workers-ai-embeddings-and-reranking-are-included\"><span class=\"anchor-icon\"><svg height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 ", "url": "https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-10-01-ai-search-generally-available/", "published_at": "2026-10-01T00:00:00+00:00", "recorded_at": "2026-10-01T15:08:17.246177+00:00", "keyword_pass": true, "relevance_pass": false, "change_kind": null, "importance": null}
